Z||000000||x-thumpr-x||10-31-2001||09:48 PM||||Is there a thing of too much time in PFF?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  Might be an addiction thing going around?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>O.K. the other day I got slated by my girlfriend (common-law) for spending too much time on the computer   well he words to be exact are:<P> " YOU spend more time on that computer then ME! "    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">      <BR> <BR> Past week been have computer problems, so I got Windows XP now.   so far so good  <BR>But back to my g/f, do you think she is right? or could it be the pre PMS thing?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Hmmm makes you wonder if there is an addiction to the PFF and Fiero's period!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>What are your thoughts, and have your other haves slated you at all?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  <P>[This message has been edited by x-thumpr-x (edited 10-31-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by x-thumpr-x (edited 10-31-2001).]||||reg||4
