Z||000003||Cheever3000||10-31-2001||09:57 PM||||(try the eek without the exlamation mark)<P>First I knew anything fun had to be wrong.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"><BR>Then my wife complained that I spend more time talking to you guys than to her.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><BR>Then she noted that as soon as I get home from work I get on the puter before doing ANYTHING else.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>Now I acknowledge that I have a problem, but seem powerless to overcome it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><P>Maybe Cliff would be willing to write a 12-step program for us.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  I'm not saying it's his fault, but hey, if the cigarette makers are at fault, and if the gun makers are at fault, well...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever3000 (edited 10-31-2001).]||||reg||1
